            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Что хранит переменная <code>unique</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"unique = set(temperatures)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(unique)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{17.5, 18, 17}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>{17.5, 18, 17}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[17.5, 18, 18, 17]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>set(temperatures)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>{17.5, 18, 17}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>После выполнения <code>unique = set(temperatures)</code> что по-прежнему хранит <code>temperatures</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"unique = set(temperatures)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(unique)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{17.5, 18, 17}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Исходный список <code>[17.5, 18, 18, 17]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Множество <code>{17.5, 18, 17}</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Только повторяющееся значение <code>18</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Исходный список <code>[17.5, 18, 18, 17]</code>.</p></body></html>"
